<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Steady</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Bella Kay</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">a couple minutes out</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4PZQtsDTNlq5hFWmdBb5xh</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.880" end="00:05.320">I don't wanna fall in love, 'cause I don't believe that I deserve it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.320" end="00:10.360">There's always one more pound to lose, I'm not worthy if I didn't earn it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.360" end="00:15.170">I don't wanna fall in love, 'cause who could love me back on purpose?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.170" end="00:19.450">I'm always too much, I'm never enough, never your person</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.450" end="00:27.450">I can't treat you right if I treat myself like this</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.520" end="00:35.520">I need to get better, swear I'm working on it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.940" end="00:41.770">Guess I'll never be ready</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.770" end="00:46.950">Guess I'll never be good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.950" end="00:52.430">Wе will never grow steady (Stеady)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.430" end="00:56.650">I don't think that we should</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.650" end="01:01.620">Guess I'll never be ready (Ready)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.620" end="01:07.210">Guess I'll never be, never be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.210" end="01:09.360">Always wanna be more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.360" end="01:13.860">So I will never be yours</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.860" end="01:18.730">I don't wanna fall in love, 'cause I'm scared of the person I'll become</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.730" end="01:23.720">There's always one more bridge to burn, how far can I make you run?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.720" end="01:28.510">I don't wanna fall in love, 'cause I know when it's all said and done</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.510" end="01:33.460">I'm back where I started, one broken-hearted, less of the person I was</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.460" end="01:41.070">I can't treat you right if I treat myself like this</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.070" end="01:49.070">I need to get better, swear I'm working on it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.370" end="01:55.230">Guess I'll never be ready</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.230" end="02:00.460">Guess I'll never be good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.460" end="02:05.750">We will never grow steady (Steady)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.750" end="02:10.310">I don't think that we should</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.310" end="02:15.100">Guess I'll never be ready (Ready, ready)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.100" end="02:20.680">Guess I'll never be, never be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.680" end="02:22.860">Always wanna be more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.860" end="02:27.310">So I will never be yours</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.310" end="02:29.550">I can't (I want), I can't, I can't</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.550" end="02:32.020">I can't, I can't, I can't (I, I, I, I want, babe)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.020" end="02:34.460">I, I can't (I want), I can't</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.460" end="02:37.290">You know I can't, I (I, I, I, I want, babe)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.290" end="02:39.570">I can't (I want), I can't</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.570" end="02:41.580">Oh, I can't (I, I, I, I want, babe)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.580" end="02:44.320">I can't, I can't, I can't, I can't</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.320" end="02:46.360">You know I can't, I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.360" end="02:49.220">Guess I'll never be ready</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.220" end="02:54.170">Guess I'll never be good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.170" end="02:59.540">We will never grow steady (Steady)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.540" end="03:04.180">I don't think that we should</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.180" end="03:08.980">Guess I'll never be ready (Ready, ready)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:08.980" end="03:14.760">Guess I'll never be, never be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:14.760" end="03:16.660">Always wanna be more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:16.660" end="03:20.660">So I will never be yours</p></div></body></tt>